   "source": [
    "::: {.notes}\n",
    "Three things to see: strong Christmas peaks everywhere, Germany on a different scale, and Poland growing steadily from the smallest to overtaking Austria. Each of those is a variable in the model: seasonality, country level, trend. 936 rows, 6 countries times 156 weeks.\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "## Start simple: log sales against log price (Germany)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "23031007",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
